Redmond97 SE on openSUSE (home:caiocco)
=======================================

Upstream: https://codeberg.org/Sliver_X/Redmond97-SE

Packages
--------
 - redmond97-se-gtk-theme: the 42 themes "Redmond97 SE <scheme>"
   (GTK 2/3/4, Xfwm4, wine/*.reg) and the xfce4-panel-profiles layouts
 - redmond97-se-gtk-theme-hidpi: the "-HiDPI" variants (2x assets)
 - obsidian-pure-icon-theme: Obsidian Pure icons in 11 folder colors
 - redmond97-se: metapackage for the theme + icons

Differences from upstream's prebuilt themes
-------------------------------------------
The themes are generated at build time from builder/presets/*.conf with
upstream's gen_theme.sh. Two settings are changed for every preset:
 - the Whisker Menu side-bar text is drawn in DejaVu Sans Bold instead
   of Lucida Sans (not free);
 - the PNGs are not recompressed with advpng (advancecomp is not in
   openSUSE); fdupes links identical files instead.
The output is otherwise the same file set as upstream's themes tarball.

Not packaged: the gtk2-scale script (it only works with presets built
in hidpi_gtk2_mode=3; the shipped presets use mode 2) and the XPM
scaler. extras/r97se-fixes.sh is in the docs.

Setting it up in Xfce
---------------------
 - Settings > Appearance: Style "Redmond97 SE <scheme>"; Icons e.g.
   "Obsidian-Pure-Sand" (each preset's index.theme names its icons)
 - Settings > Window Manager: Theme "Redmond97 SE <scheme>"
 - Panels need a border of at least 1px and fixed icon sizes (16px
   icons on a 32px panel); or restore one of the Redmond97-SE_* layouts
   with xfce4-panel-profiles
 - CSD button order and GTK icon sizes (xfsettingsd overrides them):
     sh /usr/share/doc/packages/redmond97-se-gtk-theme/r97se-fixes.sh
   e.g. as a session autostart entry
 - Wine: in a prefix, run regedit and import
     "/usr/share/themes/Redmond97 SE <scheme>/wine/Redmond97 SE <scheme>.reg"
   then in winecfg > Desktop Integration set Theme to "(No Theme)"
 - Qt: QT_QPA_PLATFORMTHEME=gtk3, or qt5ct/qt6ct with the gtk2 style

HiDPI: pick the "-HiDPI" style, cursor size 32 and 2x window scaling
in Appearance > Settings.

Licenses
--------
Themes: GPL-3.0 (builder/src/LICENSE), from Redmond97 by matthewmx86.
Obsidian Pure: GPL-3.0, fork of madmaxms' Obsidian / Faenza by
Matthieu James. Like most icon themes it has brand icons for
applications (including Microsoft ones such as Teams, Office Online).
The Microsoft-named presets (Windows 95, Plus! schemes) are only color
values; no Microsoft artwork is included.
